'''Erihann''' is an [[NPC]] located in the {{Zone|Wizard Tower}}. The player can imbue their {{Item|Rift Prism}} to them for {{c|200k}} to consume it and gain {{Accessory Power|11}} and free entry to the [[Rift Dimension]].

