*The {{c|200k}} is not affected by {{Item|Seal of the Family}} accessory line.
*The {{gold|11 Accessory Power}} would be the same as if the accessory was [[Recombobulator 3000|Recombobulated]], but without spending a slot in the [[Accessory Bag]].

